msgid "首发为启明STM32F407ZGT6、天空星STM32F407VET6和梁山派GD32F470ZGT6，裸机/ FreeRTOS、显式 ThreadX 及 Native 模型。新增 F103RBT6／GD32F303RCT6 参考及 G474／H743／U575 增量按各文档的精确配置、完整镜像与 SDK 退出条件验收，不从公共 类型推断完整系列或全部外设。F103/GD303 增加有限 UART channel-DMA、I2C IRQ、 物理 Flash、单次 ADC 与固定 PWM；GD303 另维护 EXTI 和硬件级联 timebase。 G474 的既有 GPIO/UART/SPI/PWM/IWDG/EXTI 之外，选入 bulb ADC 单次／有限 TIM6 DMA、I2C1 和 ECC Flash。H743 的固定 HSI/cache 支持有限 TX DMA 或有 rearm 间隙的 RX block，可显式初始化 D2 SRAM1；独立 V／HSI64／裸机参考在 Cache off/on 下增加 SPI4 有限 DMA 和 USART3 连续双缓冲 RX。`rx-dma-continuous` 保留独立 IRQ TX；另选 `dma-duplex-continuous` 才增加有限 TX DMA。新双向模式只接入 AXI SRAM， RX 使用至少三个等长 block，不能推导为 FreeRTOS、PLL384 或 D2 SRAM 支持；另有 七类有限外设的软件夹具。U575 TZEN0 增加 SPI/I2C/ADC/PWM/EXTI/Flash，外部电源与安全状态准入仍适用。 独立无 OS 的 TZEN1 GPIO 参考可复制最多八条命令到 Secure slot，再由调用者逐步 推进；不保留 NS 指针，不代表通用双域 factory、NS RTOS 或异步借用。 ECC `program_flags`、fresh-erase 来源与逐脉冲完成责任见公共 Flash 合同；当前源 实现和最终集成资格分别记录，不继承历史执行计数。 SOC-33 的有限软件增量见上述边界页，完整退出仍开放；SOC-34/35 仍未实现， RTC RUN 不建立深 STOP 连续计时； SOC-36 保留 partial，SOC-37–55 的物理验收仍为 not_executed。 三Board未审实物PCB事实仍标unknown；软件测试夹具不升格真实 Board路线。角色沿用十人配置：TL1、Core/I/O/OS2、BSP2、通用应用/通信2、QA/HIL2、 构建发布1；维护责任由Codex全部承担，无需实名人员。远程branch protection状态 须通过GitHub独立核实，不能从本地角色文件推断。"
msgstr "First-release references are Qiming STM32F407ZGT6, Sky STM32F407VET6 and Liangshan GD32F470ZGT6, with baremetal/FreeRTOS, explicit ThreadX and Native models. New F103RBT6/GD32F303RCT6 references and G474/H743/U575 increments follow each contract's exact configuration, complete-image and SDK exits; public types do not imply whole-family or all-peripheral support. F103/GD303 add finite UART channel-DMA, IRQ I2C, physical Flash, single-shot ADC and fixed PWM. GD303 also maintains EXTI and a hardware-cascaded timebase. G474 adds bulb ADC shots/finite TIM6 DMA, I2C1 and ECC Flash beside GPIO/UART/SPI/PWM/IWDG/EXTI. H743 fixed HSI/Cache supports finite TX DMA or RX blocks with rearm gaps and explicitly initialized D2 SRAM1. Separate V/HSI64/baremetal references add finite SPI4 DMA and continuous double-buffered USART3 RX with Cache off/on. `rx-dma-continuous` retains independent IRQ TX; only the separately selected `dma-duplex-continuous` adds finite TX DMA. The new duplex mode admits only AXI SRAM, with at least three equal RX blocks; it does not imply FreeRTOS, PLL384 or D2 SRAM support. Seven other finite peripheral classes have software fixtures. U575 TZEN0 adds SPI/I2C/ADC/PWM/EXTI/Flash with external supply and security-state admission. Its independent no-OS TZEN1 GPIO reference copies up to eight commands into a Secure slot for caller-driven progress; it retains no NS pointer and does not provide a generic dual-world factory, NS RTOS or asynchronous borrow. The public Flash contract owns ECC `program_flags`, fresh-erase provenance and per-pulse completion. Current implementation and final integrated qualification are recorded separately without inherited historical counts. The bounded SOC-33 software increment is described by the boundary page above; its complete exits remain open. SOC-34/35 remain unimplemented; RTC RUN does not establish continuous deep-STOP timing. SOC-36 remains partial, and SOC-37–55 physical acceptance not_executed. Unobserved PCB facts for the three Boards remain unknown; software fixtures do not become actual Board routes. The ten-person capacity model remains TL1, Core/I/O/OS2, BSP2, common applications/communications2, QA/HIL2 and build/release1. Codex owns all maintenance without requiring named accounts. Remote branch protection must be independently observed through GitHub rather than inferred from local role files."
